1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:03,520
How to work with this course.

2
00:00:04,030 --> 00:00:08,020
Each lesson contains a short video lecture.

3
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:15,340
Sometimes during the video, I will ask you to pause the video and repeat after me.

4
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:20,800
Feel free to pause the videos as many times as needed.

5
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:30,130
After watching the video for several times, you should find a worksheet and do all the tasks and exercises

6
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:30,580
in it.

7
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:37,150
If you have a printer at home, it is good to print out the sheets in advance.

8
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:41,080
The course consists of 15 lectures.

9
00:00:41,170 --> 00:00:50,380
I would recommend you to do three four lectures per week, so overall the course can take you around

10
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:53,710
4 to 5 weeks to accomplish.

11
00:00:54,640 --> 00:01:01,670
At the last lesson, you will find a worksheet with all the answers to the previous lesson, so you

12
00:01:01,670 --> 00:01:04,790
will be able to check if you were correct.

13
00:01:05,550 --> 00:01:06,180
Good luck.
